{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/making_screen_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:26:47.046739Z","id":"665bec2397203bd0754662012fd521ab9f10853618c73e215d51a277b455dd85","body":{"detail":"MakingLog._progress keeps html when a PartialFile is shorter than what is shown (lib/ui/making_screen.dart:201-206). The shots test streams PartialFile('index.html', 'early') then 'mid' with no step between, so target/flutter-app/u1/making-3-mid-*.png repeat page-early-*.png and the mid page is never rendered.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":142},"end":{"line":144},"content_hash":"a777b128b5396175b57b5172cd63cf68fd48c35e62babb0b192a5698eec6b900"},"suggested_fix":"Key the fake frames by texts that grow (for example 'early' and 'middle').","summary":"The '3-mid' render shows the early frame: the fake text 'mid' is shorter than 'early', so MakingLog holds it as a shrink","tags":["review","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
